00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.515
So the reporter there, Ilya, explained

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:30.049
why Putin is using this train.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:30.683
Here he is again

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.587
He's scared.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:37.257
He's scared that he can be tracked, that

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.791
his plane can be tracked,

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.994
and that his plane can be shot.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.197
Down by NATO air forces

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:47.367
or by the air forces of Ukraine,

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:50.503
a wise missile, some kind of a missile

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.205
that he is Crimean, British

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.474
or anything like this can happen.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:55.742
So he's scared

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.177
and he believes that it is

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.312
a more secure way to travel,

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.981
that nobody will know where he is going,

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.982
and nobody will understand

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.684
that he's inside history

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:05.518
and nobody

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.320
will even try to do something

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.755
