00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.500
It is a pretty stunning thing to say that

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.134
this is, you know,

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:22.101
that Putin is so worried

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.170
